## 3. Copyright Ownership

The Software remains the intellectual property of the Original Author and its respective contributors.

Nothing in this License transfers ownership of the original Software.

The copyright holder retains all rights that are not expressly granted by this License.

The availability of the Software on GitHub or any other public platform does not constitute a transfer of ownership.

This section confirms that copyright ownership does not change just because the Software is publicly available or licensed. The Original Author and contributors retain ownership of their respective parts. Public availability on GitHub or elsewhere is a distribution mechanism, not a transfer of rights. This distinction is important because some people mistakenly believe that open-source or public code is automatically public domain. This license expressly rejects that idea.

