The name __Halziz__, its logos, visual identity, and associated trademarks are not licensed under this Software License.

Use of Software created by Henok Akriso does not grant permission to use __Halziz__ as a company name, product name, service name, logo, or official branding.

Permission to use Halziz branding must be obtained separately where required.

This section specifically protects the Halziz brand. The name Halziz, its logos, visual identity, and associated trademarks are not licensed under this Software License. Using the Software does not grant permission to use Halziz as a company name, product name, service name, logo, or official branding. Separate permission is required for such use. This ensures that the Halziz brand remains under the control of its owner.

