## 17. No False Endorsement

You may not claim or imply that:

1. Henok Akriso endorses your product.
2. Sergio endorses your product.
3. Halziz endorses your product.
4. Your product is an official ARWE product.
5. Your product is an official release of the Original Project.

unless you have explicit authorization.

This section prohibits false endorsement. You cannot claim or imply that Henok Akriso, Sergio, or Halziz endorses your product, or that your product is an official ARWE product or an official release of the Original Project, unless you have explicit authorization. This prevents third parties from leveraging the author's reputation without permission.

