Third-party components remain subject to their respective licenses.

This License does not replace, restrict, or override the licenses of third-party components.

You are responsible for complying with applicable third-party license requirements.

This section clarifies that the Software may include third-party components, and those components remain subject to their own licenses. This license does not replace, restrict, or override third-party licenses. Users are responsible for complying with those third-party license requirements. This is important because a project may bundle libraries with different terms, and users must respect all applicable licenses.

